Z||000005||pherder||05-14-2001||09:32 PM||||I have had great success with RCC's version.  @ $29.95 for the V6, the price was right!<P>Since the dogbone is only three pieces of metal and poly bushings ... (two round ends for the poly bushings and a shaft to connect the two!) ... why pay extra?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Contact RCC @  <A HREF="mailto:dwayne9@airmail.net">dwayne9@airmail.net</A> <P>Paul||||reg||1
